{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "target": "ES2022",
    "rootDir": "src",
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": true,
    "noImplicitAny": false,
    "strictNullChecks": false,
    "noImplicitThis": false,
    "useUnknownInCatchVariables": false,
    "declaration": false,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts"],
  "//": [
    "rc.7 起 src 全量 .ts（无 allowJs）。strict:true 名义保留，但过渡期显式关闭",
    "noImplicitAny/strictNullChecks/noImplicitThis/useUnknownInCatchVariables 四个分量：",
    "逐字搬移的 6000+ 行 JS 一次性补全标注不现实，收紧计划见 findings。"
  ]
}
